        "TileImage": "$($repository 53406e7a-83d4-4dfd-a5f9-839d6f5e3baa).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47!\r\rYour next targets are two scammers who sale houses without the knowledge of the owners, or the buyers. The pair scouts out houses which have been vacant for a long period of time, and once they are certain the owners will be away for good, they clean it out and start advertising it to costumers. Once they got their cut from the transaction, they disappear.\rThe pair currently tries to sell such a house in Whittleton Creek.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
